{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>BYTEWORLD,\u00a0</strong>the ultimate customisation experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On an island out in the middle of the pacific ocean, a giant paper bag man lives amongst his many little robots, called Bytes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These Bytes sure do love to dress up to look their best, and that's exactly what you can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the costume designer to apply any number of cosmetics to your Byte, from crowns to tuxedos to even a banana suit! The possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you have completed your getup, you can then save the outfit and share it for all your friends to see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So what are you waiting for, starting designing now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3279000?t=1745012015","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3279000?t=1745012015","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279000/66e8a232bd02fb60ff4007aff7820f1bd89428ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745012015","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279000/66e8a232bd02fb60ff4007aff7820f1bd89428ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745012015","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mild profanity and occasional innuendo"},"demos":[{"appid":3279100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>BYTEWORLD,\u00a0</strong>the ultimate customisation experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On an island out in the middle of the pacific ocean, a giant paper bag man lives a